dialogs
0	I'm the best out of all my friends. But here… I've been useless!
2	Hello, are you here for the ferry? May I see your TICKET?
3	Ah, so this here is the BATTLE DOME? I won't let GENTLEMEN beat me!But where is the entrance?
4	It's not as if just anyone can come here, you know?Only those TRAINERS who've been recognized as tough are brought here.That's why many TRAINERS don't even know about the BATTLE FRONTIER.
5	I've finally arrived at the BATTLE FRONTIER!I'm sure to grab attention with my looks and ability!
6	Munch, munch…It looks like this square's filled with tough people.Munch, munch…
7	Oh? You're off to challenge the BATTLE DOME?I'll wish you the best of luck. Let us both win our way up and meet in challenges.
10	There used to be nothing here not all that long ago.But, now look at this place! Amazing! I'll bring my mother out to see this.
12	Let's play rock, paper, scissors! One, two, three!… … … … … …
13	That's the BATTLE FACTORY. You can rent strong POKéMON there.But it makes me wonder. Who's raising those rental POKéMON?
14	Today, I'm going to keep battling, no matter what, until I get a Symbol.
16	I believe I'm the only person here who, for some unknown reason, would choose fishing over battling.Huh? You can't catch anything here? That's disappointing…
18	Crunch, munch…A while back, I met this older girl at the BATTLE PIKE.She had these eyes that were scary in a real ornery way.Crunch, munch…She got all furious: “Will you quit eating!” Then she whaled on me.It was a hair-raising kind of scary experience, sure enough.Crunch, munch…
19	Huh? Will you listen to yourself? That's nothing!Why, the last time I cheered for him, our eyes met and sparks flew!
20	Whaaaaaat?! Pfft!That only happened because I happened to be sitting next to you!The DOME ACE only looked our way because my cheering was so loud!
21	Oh, shush! Keep that racket down!You fair-weather fans should stick to cheering for some GYM LEADER!The DOME ACE is mine! The only idol for me!
22	Those people squabbling over there…It's hard to believe, but they once were TRAINERS, and good ones, too.They used to be incredibly tough, and they were famous, too.But they were obliterated by this certain TRAINER at a tournament.They were so thoroughly whipped, they became smitten by the TRAINER.Now they're just fans of the TRAINER. They go cheer for their idol at the BATTLE DOME every day now.
23	I heard a rumor that someone saw a POKéMON with an unusually long tail somewhere in the BATTLE FRONTIER.It must be adorable. I'm sure of it…Oh, challenges can wait. I feel driven to find the delightful creature!
