scriptdefs
= BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_EventScript_PokefanF
msgbox	I heard a rumor that someone saw a POKéMON with an unusually long tail somewhere in the BATTLE FRONTIER.It must be adorable. I'm sure of it…Oh, challenges can wait. I feel driven to find the delightful creature!
end
= BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_EventScript_Man4
lock
faceplayer
msgbox	Those people squabbling over there…It's hard to believe, but they once were TRAINERS, and good ones, too.They used to be incredibly tough, and they were famous, too.But they were obliterated by this certain TRAINER at a tournament.They were so thoroughly whipped, they became smitten by the TRAINER.Now they're just fans of the TRAINER. They go cheer for their idol at the BATTLE DOME every day now.
closemessage
applymovement LOCALID_FRONTIER_MAN_4 Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_EventScript_OldMan
msgbox	Oh, shush! Keep that racket down!You fair-weather fans should stick to cheering for some GYM LEADER!The DOME ACE is mine! The only idol for me!
end
